// Native fixedValue omega boundary for wall-resolved SST and DES.
// Units: 1/s. Set for the actual mesh and constant/transportProperties viscosity.
// SST wall asymptote: omega = 60*nu/(beta1*y1^2), beta1 = 0.075.
// y1 is wall-to-first-cell-centre distance, NOT full first-layer thickness.
// Example: nu = 1.5e-5 m2/s, y1 = 2.5e-5 m gives 1.92e7 1/s.
// This example is not inferred from the mesh or the cfMesh layer thickness cap.
// A nonuniform List<scalar> can replace uniform for varying wall distances;
// entries must follow the propeller patch face order before decomposition.
omegaWallValue uniform 1.92e7;
